**Step 3 — first moment FM.** [pcest] §2.3 Theorem FM, with [pcest] §2.2 Lemma 8.5′, re-checked for
(a‴_k; μ) in [ld] §2 (proof applied for each fixed w, uniformly in w, then averaged).
