| quantity | exponent of N (zero slack) | source |
|---|---|---|
| special-q prime ℓ | 2ν | §1, J |
| box radius V | ν (+ L^{O(1)}) | V = √ℓ S |
| rational modulus t = \|G(P)\| | μ + ν | \|G\| ∈ [MV/32, 2MV] |
| rational cofactor G/ℓ | μ − ν | X_r |
